        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/07/meta-launches-muse-for-ipad-following-weeks-as-the-top-iphone-app/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/Muse-by-Meta.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Meta’s Muse AI agent app has <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/18/metas-new-muse-ai-agent-app-overtakes-chatgpt-as-top-iphone-app/\">spent the last several weeks</a> as the #1 free iPhone app on the U.S. App Store. The latest Muse app update adds a new platform to tackle: iPad.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,apps,ipad,meta,muse\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1073128\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/07/meta-launches-muse-for-ipad-following-weeks-as-the-top-iphone-app/#more-1073128\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
