        "url": "https://9to5google.com/2026/10/06/google-ai-edge-foresight/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/Google-AI-Edge-Foresight.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Google today <a href=\"https://developers.googleblog.com/en/introducing-embeddinggemma/\">announced</a> its new EmbeddingGemma 2 model that can be used to “organize, search, and connect information directly on consumer hardware.” To show off its potential, Google created an AI Edge Foresight Mac app for “intelligent notetaking.”</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072970\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/10/06/google-ai-edge-foresight/#more-1072970\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
