        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/john-ternus-sep-2026-keynote.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/05/apple-two-sets-of-product-launches-october/\"><em>MacRumors</em></a> reports that in addition to Apple’s expected event on October 13, the company is planning to unveil another batch of new products in the final week of the month. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,imac,ipad-mini,macbook-pro\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072813\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/apple-reportedly-planning-second-wave-of-product-announcements-later-this-month/#more-1072813\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
