        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/pelican-case.jpg.webp?w=1500\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As the weather cools off and the fall outdoor season ramps up, I tend to tweak my everyday carry list to match how I ams spending my time. The Pelican MagSafe Wallet &amp; Card Holder is my go-to option when you want something a little more rugged that can handle the outdoors but still works as a great everyday wallet.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"magsafe-monday\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1070664\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/magsafe-monday-pelicans-magsafe-wallet-is-my-go-to-wallet-for-the-fall/#more-1070664\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
