        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/icloud-just-rolled-out-an-improved-perk-for-subscribers/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/icloud-ios-27-blue.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iCloud+ includes a lot more than additional storage, and one of the service’s perks for subscribers—custom email domains—just got even better.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"icloud\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072707\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/icloud-just-rolled-out-an-improved-perk-for-subscribers/#more-1072707\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
