        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://youtu.be/TxbJs-wC9eo\">Measuring the behavior of a cut and folded sheet.</a> Many minute-or-two videos from a lab working on metamaterials &#8212; possibly up for use during a conference?<br/><br/>I find them peaceful to watch. \n\n<a href=\"https://youtu.be/wlQIS5B-Hew\">One sheet, folded and unfolded by hand</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://youtu.be/xjUT9Ni_z8I\">Seven of those sheets stacked</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://youtu.be/NEnygEWD2Kw\">Visualization of the cross-section of a sort of broccoli-saddle construction printed of several materials</a>",
