        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/08/the-best-carplay-upgrades-to-try-ios-27/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/carplay27-1.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple released iOS 27 to everyone a few weeks ago, and it includes several CarPlay changes worth checking out. Here are a few changes I’ve been loving so far.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1061228\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/08/the-best-carplay-upgrades-to-try-ios-27/#more-1061228\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
