        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/macos-27-2-reveals-new-clues-about-apples-touchscreen-macbook-pro/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/10/macbook-pro-m5-14-inch.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is widely expected to release a new touchscreen MacBook Pro as soon as this month. This will mark the first-ever touchscreen Mac, and Apple is laying the groundwork in macOS 27.2 to accommodate touch gestures.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"macbook-pro\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1072786\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/05/macos-27-2-reveals-new-clues-about-apples-touchscreen-macbook-pro/#more-1072786\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
