        "title": "The Agentic Data Science Playbook",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-agentic-data-science-playbook/",
        "content_text": "The following article originally appeared on Vanishing Gradients and is being republished here with the authors’ permission When an AI agent can explore a dataset, choose a modeling approach, run the analysis, and explain its findings, what should the data scientist do? Traditionally, data scientists chose each step and implemented much of the analysis themselves. [&#8230;]",
        "type": "Technology",
